  comment 3. Neurodynamical Divergent Ideation Stability (Theorem 323): Divergent cognitive attractors converge monotonically under BMRC (gamma = 875/1000),;
  comment 4. Auditory/Haptic Tactile Commutation (Theorem 324): Clay deformation triggers deterministic feedback channels synchronized with PBX tone lines,;
